 ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.009" end="00:58.198"><span begin="00:55.009" end="00:55.218">I </span><span begin="00:55.218" end="00:55.408">can </span><span begin="00:55.408" end="00:55.578">taste </span><span begin="00:55.578" end="00:55.918">it </span><span begin="00:55.918" end="00:56.098">my </span><span begin="00:56.098" end="00:56.468">heart's </span><span begin="00:56.468" end="00:56.738">breakin' </span><span begin="00:56.738" end="00:57.038">please </span><span begin="00:57.038" end="00:57.458">don't </span><span begin="00:57.458" end="00:58.198">say</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.978" end="01:02.467"><span begin="00:58.978" end="00:59.148">That </span><span begin="00:59.148" end="00:59.328">you </span><span begin="00:59.328" end="01:00.848">know </span><span begin="01:00.848" end="01:01.038">when </span><span begin="01:01.038" end="01:01.398">you </span><span begin="01:01.398" end="01:02.467">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.897" end="01:07.207"><span begin="01:03.897" end="01:04.077">I </span><span begin="01:04.077" end="01:04.237">can't </span><span begin="01:04.237" end="01:04.417">take </span><span begin="01:04.417" end="01:04.787">it </span><span begin="01:04.787" end="01:04.977">I'm </span><span begin="01:04.977" end="01:05.667">inpatient </span><span begin="01:05.667" end="01:05.987">tell </span><span begin="01:05.987" end="01:06.317">me </span><span begin="01:06.317" end="01:07.207">baby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.027" end="01:11.547"><span begin="01:08.027" end="01:08.287">Now </span><span begin="01:08.287" end="01:08.567">I </span><span begin="01:08.567" end="01:09.777">know </span><span begin="01:09.777" end="01:09.957">you </span><span begin="01:09.957" end="01:10.277">should </span><span begin="01:10.277" end="01:11.547">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.016" end="01:16.975"><span begin="01:12.016" end="01:12.536">I </span><span begin="01:12.536" end="01:13.636">know </span><span begin="01:13.636" 